  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>⚠️ [ 重要 ] ⚠️</strong></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>若要獲得完整的3D和反射效果，請搭配<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/bsl-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSL光影</a></span>使用，並在設定中啟用「高級材質」：</strong></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><em><strong>（光影包設定 &gt; 材質 &gt; 高級材質：開啟）</strong></em></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>若需設定協助，請在<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/primemods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span>上提問 :)</strong></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🌱</strong></h1><h2 style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>這是Prime's HD紋理材質包的免費版本。更高解析度與更多內容請前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.primemods.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">primemods.net</span></a></strong></span></h2><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🔧</strong></h1><h2 style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>追蹤材質包的開發進度：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://youtube.com/@prime_mods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a></span>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftiktok.com%252f%2540prime_mods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">TikTok</span></a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finstagram.com%252fprime_mods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Instagram</span></a></strong></span></h2><p style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>👥 致謝：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align:left\">部分暫用預設紋理，經<strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@GaboReviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Gabo Reviews</span></a></strong>許可後使用</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align:left\">部分暫用高光貼圖，靈感來自<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252favpbr-retextured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">AVBPR</span></a></strong>，經JoaquiX許可後使用</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align:left\">3D柵欄模型來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fundopia.net%252fprojects%252fundopia-patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Undopia Patch</span></strong></a>，經UnduGT許可後使用</li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.apexminecrafthosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d7921\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.apexminecrafthosting.com/img/theme/apex-hosting-mobile.png\" width=\"849\" height=\"143\"></a></p>",
